# Every URL redirects to the paused notice at /paused/, except the GitHub App
# webhook receiver, which keeps running as a background function while paused.
# First match wins. Netlify serves /.netlify/functions/* before redirects are
# evaluated (verified on the PR #1864 deploy preview), and a rule with that
# path as its source is rejected as invalid, so only the legacy aliases are
# listed here.
# (Netlify ignores rules whose target is exactly "/", hence the /paused/ path.)
/api/github-webhook                            /.netlify/functions/github-webhook-background  200!
/api/github/webhook                            /.netlify/functions/github-webhook-background  200!
/paused/*  /paused/index.html  200
/*         /paused/            302!
